{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/0631ce2c85c5275a45a6eb28cf750ddb.avif?t=1738407926\" width=616 height=245 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/bee7c9fc85f1ba8f873533c226f63e50.poster.avif?t=1738407926\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/bee7c9fc85f1ba8f873533c226f63e50.webm?t=1738407926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Welcome to the Early Access of Heroes of Noname!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/81043634689b24c6a62d8d98243974c9.webp?t=1738407926\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/81043634689b24c6a62d8d98243974c9.poster.avif?t=1738407926\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, you'll have the opportunity to be a part of the game's development and even leave your mark on it, with your name in the credits or an in-game tribute based on your contributions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/4168a8cc1dd136af3994483342b9ed13.avif?t=1738407926\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras_big/4168a8cc1dd136af3994483342b9ed13.avif?t=1738407926 width=800 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes of Noname is an RPG focused on exploration and combat. Explore a massive, ever-expanding world. Recruit unique characters. Find and combine various items to customize your characters. Multiple minigames and seasonal content. Join our Discord and become a part of our growing community! Share your experience, report bugs, and send suggestions to help us build this world together with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/c600aa02eb3cce192cd5cefe7169873e.avif?t=1738407926\" width=159 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still planning an english version...</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"In\u00edcio da Jornada","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2427310/021790a143ecdbf7e186f403895e907faacb9d9e.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2427310?t=1738407926","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738407926","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738407926","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738407926","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/0631ce2c85c5275a45a6eb28cf750ddb.avif?t=1738407926\" width=616 height=245 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/bee7c9fc85f1ba8f873533c226f63e50.poster.avif?t=1738407926\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/bee7c9fc85f1ba8f873533c226f63e50.webm?t=1738407926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Welcome to the Early Access of Heroes of Noname!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/81043634689b24c6a62d8d98243974c9.webp?t=1738407926\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/81043634689b24c6a62d8d98243974c9.poster.avif?t=1738407926\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, you'll have the opportunity to be a part of the game's development and even leave your mark on it, with your name in the credits or an in-game tribute based on your contributions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/4168a8cc1dd136af3994483342b9ed13.avif?t=1738407926\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras_big/4168a8cc1dd136af3994483342b9ed13.avif?t=1738407926 width=800 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes of Noname is an RPG focused on exploration and combat. Explore a massive, ever-expanding world. Recruit unique characters. Find and combine various items to customize your characters. Multiple minigames and seasonal content. Join our Discord and become a part of our growing community! Share your experience, report bugs, and send suggestions to help us build this world together with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/c600aa02eb3cce192cd5cefe7169873e.avif?t=1738407926\" width=159 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still planning an english version...</p>","developers":["KotaRRH"],"dlc":[2628840,3124250],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/header.jpg?t=1738407926","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Copia n\u00e3o Com\u00e9dia.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2427310/731474/ef7c0fe21fd3400700a9ef5bfd0f36139b774ee5/1750917778/dash_av1.mpd?t=1722014550","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2427310/731474/ef7c0fe21fd3400700a9ef5bfd0f36139b774ee5/1750917778/dash_h264.mpd?t=1722014550","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2427310/731474/ef7c0fe21fd3400700a9ef5bfd0f36139b774ee5/1750917778/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1722014550","id":257040960,"name":"Trailer Steam 3","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257040960/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1722014550"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2427310/666394/f4dc4bbd697396d29222d17210220af480fba774/1750917773/dash_av1.mpd?t=1722014559","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2427310/666394/f4dc4bbd697396d29222d17210220af480fba774/1750917773/dash_h264.mpd?t=1722014559","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2427310/666394/f4dc4bbd697396d29222d17210220af480fba774/1750917773/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1722014559","id":257003267,"name":"Abertura Beta 5 Steam","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257003267/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1722014559"}],"name":"Her\u00f3is de Non